Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's stay a bit more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's almost bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sleepy at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be with you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall I take you somewhere fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Somewhere fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay if we go somewhere else first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.90,0:00:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, you're heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you even have an aquarium?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, but we have a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't put it there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you get home, put it in a bucket of tap-water and flush it in the veranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.41,0:01:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tap-water has chlorine in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Come on!{yoshi... kore!}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.47,0:01:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold still a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know about this spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.27,0:02:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it Rin's first time here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, this is our first summer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too dark. I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mere c'mere...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so late! Are we still doing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds like someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, come with me, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,G'night...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go too.{If I hear one more of these I'll flip shit}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten taller, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:10.10,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\fad(942,934)\pos(307,181)}The way {back }home
